			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Correct Sky path resolution and add extension scanning instrumentation\n\nThree related improvements to extension management and path resolution:\n\n1. **Fix Sky target path resolution** - The monorepo layout places Sky at `Land/Element/Sky/`, but the code was incorrectly using `Element/Sky/Target` (doubling Element). Change from `../../../Element/Sky/Target` to `../../../Sky/Target` in ScanPathConfigure.rs, AppLifecycle.rs, and InitializationData.rs.\n\n2. **Add dev-only cfg guards** - Wrap dev fallback paths in `#[cfg(debug_assertions)]` to keep release builds lean. Production should fail loudly if the bundle is misconfigured rather than silently falling back to dev paths.\n\n3. **Add extension scanning instrumentation** - Comprehensive logging throughout the scanning pipeline:\n   - ScanAndPopulateExtensions: track inserted vs rejected (empty identifier) counts\n   - Scanner: log directory entries, parse failures, missing package.json\n   - MountainEnvironment: verify serialized non-null extensions\n   - Extension handler: log serialized payload sizes, warn on empty results\n   - Also register native `setContext` command as no-op for VS Code extension compatibility\n\n4. **Implement FileSystem effects** - Add FileSystem.Stat, CreateDirectory, Delete, Rename, Copy effects to CreateEffectForRequest, completing the IPC bridge between Wind requests and Mountain's FileSystemReader/Writer traits.",
			"SHA": "3ba96f11406420784098879a309de9cd997c2fcf"
