			"Message": "chore(Mountain): Add json macro import to MountainVinegRPCService\n\nAdd serde_json::json macro to imports in MountainVinegRPCService to enable JSON construction for gRPC message handling. This supports building structured JSON payloads for the Vine protocol service layer.",
